.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

.cursor/rules/nx-rules.mdc
.github/instructions/nx.instructions.md

# Replit
.cache/
.local/
.agents/
.replit
.replitignore
replit.md
**/.replit-artifact/
.migration-backup/

